  "title": "Dataform Workspaces Gain Commit History Access",
  "summary": "Dataform now allows developers to programmatically fetch the commit history of a workspace, enhancing Git integration. A new field for personal authentication in Git remote settings is also available.",
  "details": "A new method, `projects.locations.repositories.workspaces.fetchHistory`, has been added. This method enables developers to retrieve the commit history for a specified workspace, returning a `FetchWorkspaceHistoryResponse` which includes a list of `CommitLogEntry` objects, pagination tokens, and a flag indicating if the shallow boundary of the repository is reached. Additionally, the `GitRemoteSettings` schema now includes an optional `accountConnector` field, providing a way to specify an Account Connector for personal authentication with Git remotes.",
